+    * <p/>
+    * and14.44.
+    * The entity
+    * tag MAY
+    * be used
+    * for
+    * comparison with
+    * other entities
+    * from the
+    * <p/>
+    * same resource(see section13.3.3)
+    * <p/>
+    * .,
+    * <p/>
+    * <p/>
+    * ETag="ETag"":"entity-tag
